    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "カツラギエース",
            "enName": "Katsuragi Ace",
            "jpText": "えっ！！　バースデーカード！？\nあたしに！！？　シービーが！！！？？",
            "enText": "What?! A birthday card?! \nFor me? From you?!",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 1910102014157314838,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ミスターシービー",
            "enName": "Mr. C.B.",
            "jpText": "うん、さっきルドルフがエースを\nお祝いしてるの見たら思い出してさ。\n急いで準備したんだ。",
            "enText": "Mhm. I remembered when I saw Rudolf \nwishing you a happy birthday earlier, \nso it's a bit last minute.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -439523161506545620,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "はは、それを本人の前で\n言ってしまうのが君らしいというか……。",
            "enText": "Heh, only you would admit that \nto the birthday girl's face.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 7961227315520587753,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カツラギエース",
            "enName": "Katsuragi Ace",
            "jpText": "すっっげぇ嬉しい！！\nありがとなシービー！！！！！",
            "enText": "I'm <i>so</i> happy! Thanks, C.B.!!!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -7592571224283325366,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ミスターシービー",
            "enName": "Mr. C.B.",
            "jpText": "あ、カードだけじゃないよ。\nちゃんとプレゼント付き、\n読んでみて。",
            "enText": "Oh, it's not just a card. It comes with \na present too. See what it says.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -7208980157990903439,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カツラギエース",
            "enName": "Katsuragi Ace",
            "jpText": "『グラウンド、芝、2400m、SGにて待つ』？\n――もしかして、\nこれからあたしとレースしてくれんのか！？",
            "enText": "\"School turf, 2400 m, see you\nat the starting gate.\" Wait, you're\ntelling me I get to race you?!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": 7960520870908603401,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ミスターシービー",
            "enName": "Mr. C.B.",
            "jpText": "ふふっ。\nあ、今なら特別にルドルフもついてくるよ。",
            "enText": "Hehe. Oh, if we go now, you also \nget a bonus Rudolf.",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 6668732366847863551,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "えっ？",
            "enText": "Huh?",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 7691234339872260748,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カツラギエース",
            "enName": "Katsuragi Ace",
            "jpText": "マジかよ！？　シービーだけじゃなく、\nルドルフとまで勝負できんのか！？！？",
            "enText": "For real?! I get to race you <i>and</i> Rudolf?!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 63643378172387106,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ミスターシービー",
            "enName": "Mr. C.B.",
            "jpText": "ね、いいよね？　ルドルフ？",
            "enText": "You're game, aren't you, Rudolf?",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 896181034713078081,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "シンボリルドルフ",
            "enName": "Symboli Rudolf",
            "jpText": "――まったく、君たちは。\nそんな春風満面を見てしまったら\n断るなんてできる訳がないだろう。",
            "enText": "What will I ever do with you two… How could \nI say no after seeing such jubilant anticipation\non your faces?",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": -6076352173233765349,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "カツラギエース",
            "enName": "Katsuragi Ace",
            "jpText": "くぅ～～～～！！\n最高の誕生日プレゼントじゃねーか！！\nありがとな！　シービー、ルドルフ！！！！",
            "enText": "Aw, yeah!! This is the best birthday present \never!! Thanks, C.B.!!! Thanks, Rudolf!!!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "pathId": 2228286287410496477,
            "blockIdx": 12
        }
    ],
